@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra may chu -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Chi tiet bai tap 1 -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 4. Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError (ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 5. Nop bai hop le cho bai tap 1 -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv002/rest-api"
}

### 6. Doc lai luot nop vua tao theo id -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. Doc luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError (SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Nop bai thieu du lieu -> 400 + ApiError (INVALID_SUBMISSION)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 9. Nop vao bai tap da dong (id 3) -> 400 + ApiError (ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV003",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv003/rest-api"
}

### 10. Nop trung SV002 vao bai tap 1 (chay sau ca 5) -> 409 Conflict (DUPLICATE_SUBMISSION)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv002/rest-api"
}

### 11. Rut luot nop vua tao -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 12. Rut lai luot nop da xoa -> 404 + ApiError (SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND)
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
